<title>USA: Paymentech says to remain independent under merger.</title>
<headline>Paymentech says to remain independent under merger.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First USA Paymentech Inc said Thursday it and Banc One decided not to combine Paymentech and Banc One POS Services Corp right now.</p>
<p>Banc One has stated it expects to reduce its ownership in Paymentech following the merger with First USA.</p>
<p>Any such ownership reduction will only be effected if it can be accomplished in such a way as to preserve the pooling accounting treatment of the Banc One/First USA Transaction, First USA Paymentech said.</p>
</text>
